  <h2 id="agreement">1. Agreement and who can use NoBossly</h2>
  <p>These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") are an agreement between you and <%= operator %> ("NoBossly", "we", "us") about your use of nobossly.com and everything on it, including the community, quests, sprints, guides, blog, tools and any paid features (together, the "Service"). By creating an account or using the Service you agree to these Terms and to our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.</p>
  <p>You must be at least 18 years old, and able to form a binding contract where you live, to use NoBossly. If you use the Service on behalf of a business, you confirm you have the authority to accept these Terms for it.</p>

  <h2 id="service">2. What NoBossly is</h2>
  <p>NoBossly is a free community and a set of tools for people working their way out of the 9 to 5. You choose a path, take on quests, run sprints, earn XP and climb a ladder, give and get feedback from other members, and read our guides and blog. Some extra tools are part of an optional paid plan called Premium (section 10).</p>
  <p>We are always changing the Service. We may add, change, limit or remove features, content or levels of access at any time. We will try to give notice of changes that significantly affect paid members.</p>

  <h2 id="account">3. Your account</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Give us accurate information and keep it up to date. Have one account per person.</li>
    <li>Choose a username that does not impersonate someone else or infringe anyone's rights, and that is not offensive. We may change or reclaim a username that breaks this rule.</li>
    <li>Keep your password and your sign-in methods secure. You are responsible for what happens under your account. Tell us promptly at <a href="mailto:<%= contact %>"><%= contact %></a> if you suspect unauthorized use.</li>
