    <li>You can deactivate your account (log in again to reactivate it) or delete it from Account settings. Deletion is scheduled for seven days after you request it, and you can cancel during that time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="advice">4. Not professional advice, and no guarantees</h2>
  <p><strong>NoBossly provides business education and productivity tools. Nothing on the Service is legal, tax, financial, accounting, insurance, investment or other professional advice.</strong> This covers our guides, blog posts, quests, calculators and budgeting tools, templates, recommendations, any automated or AI-assisted content, and everything members say in the community. Using NoBossly does not create an attorney-client, accountant-client, advisor-client or any other professional relationship.</p>
  <p>Laws, tax rates, licensing rules and filing requirements differ by country, state and city and change over time. We try to be useful but make no promise that anything on the Service is accurate, complete or current. Check specifics with a licensed attorney, accountant or other qualified professional in your jurisdiction before you act on anything you read here. Calculators and tools give estimates based on what you enter and are not a substitute for professional advice.</p>
  <p><strong>No promise of results.</strong> Starting a business is risky and many do not succeed. We do not promise that you will make money, replace your income, reach any level, or achieve any outcome. Stories, wins and numbers shared by members or by us are examples, not typical results, and they are not a guarantee of what you will achieve. You are responsible for your own decisions, including whether to leave or keep your job. Do not risk money or income you cannot afford to lose.</p>

